iguring selfie sign-in requires you to record a video, which Google will store on its servers. Google's selfie sign-in landing page includes the typical disclaimers about privacy and data access, promising that the company will keep the video encrypted and won't use it for any other purposes unless you opt in. Read full article Commentsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iLUhe7nURYqTSvWzml6kU0YW5IMda3iEfDQmJiKsR-4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;QvQBJ1hZPyzX7R8zayQ5QXjSMYJs1pm9GO9JVTYEhvAƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pgkI6743eSj4f4lybqJxVnFE-Nx1dq_sxnOtSSX1cL4ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WL_445LsQSyrTtf0_M8EGVXa6z8hznFDiXYD7ytgiGwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IArYR7ostXHZcUSYcbgoqXrsm38xHzfmsnv07CSzR8wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MQ7gqsi5yQ4Faqp8TFnRF8h01XQiEIysycMcbgV5ILcƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pD9bkLlUodg1zAtXjeNfenrFonSbHbmqS1q1n1ZB7awƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6I6n9HJ-fEhnqRDJebAwt5M9jdYgseH3wCByFgZZAK8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ofxDiXEa5Fg4vcn1S4OPIbHxGiAiqlPzF5HjuIrYP-oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx(urn:rmn:predicate:source-reports-